<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine Inv 1996 net down 15 percent.</title>
<headline>Peregrine Inv 1996 net down 15 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   135.8	vs 165.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    28.0	 vs 28.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	  vs 663.90 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    855.65     vs 1,009.61</p>
<p>    Turnover		     175,523.62 vs 84,389.32</p>
<p>    Company name		 Peregrine Investments Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Book close		   June 3-10</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 18</p>
<p>NOTE - Peregrine Investments engages in securities dealing and property investment.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 53 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 25 cents) vs same.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
